.org","snippet":"There is a scam involving Santander customers being sent fake bank cards. Our verdict. We can't find any evidence that this scam exists.","title":"Santander bank card 'scam' probably doesn't exist","url":"https://fullfact.org/online/santander-card-scam/"},{"position":7,"site_name":"www.aba.com","snippet":"Never 'pay to play.' it's a scam. Report any suspected fraud to your bank immediately. Contact your bank and report it","title":"Fake Check Scams | American Bankers Association","url":"https://www.aba.com/advocacy/community-programs/consumer-resources/protect-your-money/fake-check-scams"},{"position":8,"site_name":"www.santanderbank.com","snippet":"Call us at 888-728-1222 if you see unauthorized activity on any of your Santander accounts. We'll never ask you to provide confidential information by text or ...","title":"What We Do to Protect Your Information","url":"https://www.santanderbank.com/personal/security-center/what-we-do"},{"position":9,"site_name":"www.wellsfargo.com","snippet":"Fake check scams. Scammers may ask you to deposit a fake check and send part of the money back. When the fake check bounces, you're responsible. Remember: Don't ...","title":"How to Recognize Common Bank and Money Scams","url":"https://www.wellsfargo.com/privacy-security/fraud/bank-scams/"},{"position":10,"site_name":"web.bankofamerica.com","snippet":"Scammers may tell you to send money or payment in less common ways ... Scammers post fake listings, advertise unreal low prices or sell counterfeit goods.","title":"Scam Prevention: Trending Scams and Their Red Flags","url":"https://web.bankofamerica.com/en/security/scam-prevention"}],"total_results":10,"page":0}